abstract: >
  Cruise planning for oceanographic research vessels: a YAML cruise description is enriched with depths and distances, validated, and turned into a schedule, maps (PNG with bathymetry and EEZ boundaries, KML), LaTeX station tables, and rolling forecasts at sea.
